      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce1 Step 1A: Extrinsic Cross-Calibration\n**[[cookbooks/11-multi-sensor-cross-calibration/README|Cookbook 11: Cross-Calibration Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Inputs**: 4K RGB Camera + LWIR Thermal + 32-beam LiDAR\n- **Algorithm**: Horn SVD Closed-Form Rigid Procrustes\n- **Target**: Sub-pixel depth reprojection into RGB frame\n- **Error**: $<0.05^\\circ$ rotation, $<1.0\\text{ mm}$ translation",
