      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf Step 2A: Real-Time 2D Object Detection\n**[[cookbooks/01-rfdetr-tensorrt/README|Cookbook 01: RF-DETR TensorRT \u2197]]**\n- **Backbone**: DINOv2 with SuperNet NAS\n- **Runtime**: TensorRT 10 FP16 (`rf_detr.engine`)\n- **Performance**: $56.9\\%\\text{ AP}$ @ $1.15\\text{ ms}$ (RTX 4090)\n- **Domain**: [[topics/object-detection/README|Object Detection Playbook]]",
