      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Step 3: Frustum Camera-to-BEV Pooling\n**[[cookbooks/14-bev-voxel-pooling-projection/README|Cookbook 14: BEV Voxel Pooling \u2197]]**\n- **Mechanism**: Lift-Splat-Shoot / BEVFusion Frustum Grid\n- **Projection**: $32\\text{k}$ frustum rays $\\to$ $128 \\times 128$ BEV grid\n- **Operation**: Segmented reduction without slow 3D convs\n- **Throughput**: $4.2\\text{ ms}$ ($238\\text{ FPS}$ on GPU)",
