    {
      "id": "node-cb-12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfc3 Step 4A: ByteTrack MOT Association\n**[[cookbooks/12-bytetrack-two-stage-association/README|Cookbook 12: ByteTrack Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Mechanism**: Two-Stage IoU Association (High + Low Score)\n- **Advantage**: Zero ID switches during severe visual occlusions\n- **Performance**: $80.3\\%\\text{ MOTA}$ @ $0.35\\text{ ms}$ per frame\n- **Domain**: [[topics/video-tracking/README|Video Tracking Production Guide]]",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -280,
