    {
      "id": "node-cb-13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udcd0 Step 4B: EPnP Analytical 6-DoF Solver\n**[[cookbooks/13-epnp-analytical-pose-solver/README|Cookbook 13: EPnP Solver Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Algorithm**: $\\mathcal{O}(n)$ Perspective-n-Point closed-form math\n- **Control Points**: 4 Virtual PCA control points + SVD null space\n- **Execution**: $0.18\\text{ ms}$ ($5,500\\text{ FPS}$ analytical speed)\n- **Domain**: [[topics/6dof-pose-estimation/README|6-DoF Pose Production Guide]]",
