    {
      "id": "node-cb-08",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Step 5A: Control Barrier Function (CBF-QP)\n**[[cookbooks/08-control-barrier-filter/README|Cookbook 08: CBF-QP Safety Filter \u2197]]**\n- **Guarantee**: Nagumo forward invariance $h(x) \\ge 0$\n- **Intervention**: Solves convex QP in $<50\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ to filter unsafe actions\n- **Integration**: Overrides deep neural policy when collision is imminent\n- **Domain**: [[topics/safety-verification-and-robustness/README|Safety Playbook]]",
      "x": 910,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-09",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udea8 Step 5B: Sim2Real Safety Gate\n**[[cookbooks/09-dann-sim2real-safety-gate/README|Cookbook 09: Sim2Real Safety Gate \u2197]]**\n- **Trigger**: Mahalanobis latent domain discrepancy monitoring\n- **Fallback**: Triggers certified fail-safe state on anomaly\n- **Catch Rate**: $99.4\\%$ out-of-distribution synthetic anomalies caught",
